 considerations in the treatment of anal cancer</article-title><source>Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys</source><year>1997</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>651</fpage><lpage>657</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9336145</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0360-3016(97)00329-5</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ferrigno</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakamura</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Dos Santos Novaes</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>Pellizzon</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Maia</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Fogarolli</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Salvajoli</surname><given-names>JV</given-names></name><name><surname>Filho</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lopes</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Radiochemotherapy in the conservative treatment of anal canal carcinoma: retrospective analysis of results and radiation dose effectiveness</article-title><source>Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys</source><year>2005</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>1136</fpage><lpage>1142</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15752894</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ijrobp.2004.07.687</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chao</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name><name><surname>Deasy</surname><given-names>JO</given-names></name><name><surname>Markman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Haynie</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Purdy</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Low</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-